more fleet of foot, giving you a 25% Enhancement bonus your movement speed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Neck Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Neck Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Jorgundal%27s_Collar_(Level_12).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Jorgundal%27s_Collar_%28Level_12%29.png/420px-Jorgundal%27s_Collar_%28Level_12%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"297\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Jorgundal%27s_Collar_%28Level_12%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This spike-studded collar was once worn as a ring by Jorgundal, the Master of the Storm's Fist. It is a reminder of the stone giant's joy in the bloody clash of armies.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817212554\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.122 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2718/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20223/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5144/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n134.28%  139.816     39 Template:IO\n100.00%  104.126      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  104.126      1 -total\n 94.79%   98.703      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 45.22%   47.086      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 43.99%   45.807      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 42.91%   44.683      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 41.93%   43.661      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.95%   19.736      5 Template:Popup\n 18.15%   18.894      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:36332-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817212554 and revision id 649317. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
